GCC 14.2.0 libstdc++ runtime tree and shared_ptr utilities. Unmodified upstream source.
https://github.com/gcc-mirror/gcc/blob/releases/gcc-14.2.0/libstdc++-v3/src/c++98/tree.cc
Also includes src/c++11/shared_ptr.cc and mutex_pool.h from the same tag.
License: GPLv3 with GCC Runtime Library Exception (included).

The same GCC 14.2 tag supplies c++11/thread.cc, condition_variable.cc and mutex.cc.
thread.cc uses native CPU/sleep hooks and disables the obsolete shared_ptr thread ABI.
gthr.h is the native target backend; tools/build/cxx-config.py configures the
matching target headers and replaces POSIX-specific clock extension calls.
